WEBVTT

00:09.040 --> 00:11.040
Why's that person on the ground?

00:12.500 --> 00:14.710
Hey! What's the matter?

00:20.630 --> 00:22.420
Sh-she's dead!

00:23.880 --> 00:25.080
What the hell?!

00:37.790 --> 00:41.880
Tomaranai koi no wana ni toriko ne muchuu ni

00:41.880 --> 00:44.630
Yosomi darling dame dame yo

00:44.630 --> 00:47.960
Itai no tondeke nokoru no ai dake

00:47.960 --> 00:50.750
Kyun to atashi no koigokoro

01:02.000 --> 01:05.000
Hitori wa kirai fureru dake de

01:05.000 --> 01:08.040
Tsunagaru you jan suki na kanji jan

01:08.040 --> 01:11.080
Mawari no iya na iken kankei nai

01:11.080 --> 01:14.170
Iwayuru ano moumoku na no

01:14.170 --> 01:17.830
Saikou na fashion sense atashi ni narenai

01:17.830 --> 01:21.210
Uruyamashii? Kanashii? Kono hanashii

01:21.210 --> 01:23.880
Mention de tsutaeru kimochi

01:23.880 --> 01:27.880
Hora kotoba de tsutaete hoshii no

01:27.880 --> 01:32.000
Tomaranai koi no wana ni toriko ne muchuu ni

01:32.000 --> 01:34.670
Yosomi darling dame dame yo

01:34.670 --> 01:38.130
Itai no tondeke nokoru no ai dake

01:38.130 --> 01:40.500
Kore mo tsurai kedo

01:40.500 --> 01:43.710
Damashite yumeyume ni obore

01:43.710 --> 01:47.000
Mou toushindai no ai wa nai yo

01:47.210 --> 01:50.290
Koi no wana ni toriko ne muchuu ni

01:50.290 --> 01:53.000
Kyun to atashi no koigokoro

01:53.210 --> 01:54.790
La la la la la

01:54.790 --> 01:56.250
Byouteki I need you

01:56.250 --> 01:57.920
La la la la la

01:57.920 --> 01:59.250
Kodoku wa yamai

01:59.250 --> 02:00.880
La la la la la

02:00.880 --> 02:02.420
Moumoku I need you

02:02.420 --> 02:05.330
Zutto anata ni I wanna muchuu

02:09.040 --> 02:10.880
What? Benten's missing?

02:10.880 --> 02:13.880
She apparently hasn't come home
in several days now.

02:13.880 --> 02:16.420
I thought that maybe she'd left to visit you.

02:16.420 --> 02:19.210
I haven't seen her at all recently.

02:19.210 --> 02:22.330
It you happen to see Benten,
tell her to contact me, okay?

02:22.330 --> 02:24.380
I have something for her.

02:24.380 --> 02:25.750
Sure thing!

02:27.210 --> 02:30.630
Come to think of it, she wasn't there
last time I tried to call, either...

02:30.630 --> 02:32.540
I wonder what happened.

02:32.540 --> 02:33.540
Yo!

02:33.540 --> 02:35.170
B-Benten?!

02:35.420 --> 02:37.210
I helped myself to your bath.

02:37.210 --> 02:39.710
Man, things have been so hectic lately.

02:39.710 --> 02:42.040
I barely have the time to keep clean!

02:42.040 --> 02:44.040
My hands are just totally full!

02:44.040 --> 02:46.880
What's been keeping you
away from home all this time?

02:49.330 --> 02:51.790
Just... doing some searching.

02:51.790 --> 02:53.330
For what?

02:54.670 --> 02:56.540
Did you lose something?

02:58.000 --> 02:59.040
This.

03:02.580 --> 03:03.750
Your chain?

03:03.750 --> 03:06.130
The one that you always wear?

03:06.130 --> 03:07.330
Yep.

03:09.920 --> 03:12.330
<b>Recovering That Which Was Lost</b>

03:17.170 --> 03:19.000
Oh my. Your chain?

03:19.000 --> 03:20.580
What happened to it?

03:20.580 --> 03:23.170
Well, I don't really know, myself...

03:24.000 --> 03:26.420
It happened about a week ago.

03:26.420 --> 03:29.380
I was in the pink mushroom forest
when I saw someone collapsed on the ground.

03:29.380 --> 03:31.420
So I went to check on them...

03:34.960 --> 03:36.630
Sh-she's dead!

03:41.130 --> 03:42.710
I woke up sometime later.

03:43.580 --> 03:45.420
Huh? She's gone.

03:51.210 --> 03:52.750
Oh no! It's gone!

03:52.750 --> 03:55.210
My chain is missing!

03:55.580 --> 03:58.250
That girl and my chain
were nowhere to be found!

03:58.250 --> 04:00.460
So, in other words, it got stolen?

04:00.460 --> 04:02.790
But by who? And what for?

04:02.790 --> 04:05.540
Shit! I gotta get it back!

04:05.540 --> 04:08.830
So, is that chain something special
to you or what?

04:09.790 --> 04:12.880
First things first.
You said you had something for me, Oyuki?

04:12.880 --> 04:14.210
Oh, that's right!

04:14.210 --> 04:15.750
<b>Unknown Sender</b>

04:14.420 --> 04:15.540
It's this.

04:15.880 --> 04:18.330
What is it?
It doesn't say who it's from...

04:23.000 --> 04:24.250
A videotape?

04:24.250 --> 04:25.630
Let's watch it.

04:38.580 --> 04:40.380
<b>BLEH!</b>

04:40.540 --> 04:41.630
<b>BLEEEEH!</b>

04:42.080 --> 04:44.670
That little shit on the right side!
She was the dead girl!

04:44.670 --> 04:45.380
Huh?

04:45.750 --> 04:47.500
Ginger the Buddha!

04:47.750 --> 04:49.580
Sugar the Rainbow!

04:49.880 --> 04:51.790
Pepper the Snake!

04:52.880 --> 04:54.000
Wassup!

04:54.000 --> 04:57.830
We are the three rowdy punksters
from Planet Middle School!

05:00.080 --> 05:03.330
<b>EMERGENCY MEETING</b>

05:03.500 --> 05:07.170
Ya know, we're some of the toughest and
rowdiest punksters this planet has ever seen.

05:07.170 --> 05:09.630
But for some reason we never
get the props we deserve.

05:09.630 --> 05:11.380
Yeah. That's because...

05:11.540 --> 05:14.830
the three punksters from the previous
generation were way too hardcore, ob-!

05:15.210 --> 05:18.920
What are they saying? That's so rude!
I am certainly not a punkster!

05:15.210 --> 05:18.920
<b>PAUSED</b>

05:19.040 --> 05:21.670
Same here!
How could they ever think that?!

05:23.080 --> 05:24.420
What're you lookin' at?

05:24.420 --> 05:26.790
I guess we get branded like that
by association

05:26.790 --> 05:28.830
because we're friends with
the likes of you.

05:28.830 --> 05:29.750
How unfair.

05:29.750 --> 05:31.170
Oh, cut the friggin' crap!

05:31.170 --> 05:32.670
You guys were rowdy as hell!

05:34.380 --> 05:35.960
Benten! Off to a fight?

05:36.170 --> 05:37.710
I wanna join in!

05:37.710 --> 05:39.670
Don't come crying to me if you get hurt.

05:39.960 --> 05:42.210
Hold on! Calm yourshellves down, girls!

05:39.960 --> 05:43.670
<b>SHUFFLE</b>

05:42.210 --> 05:43.670
Uh oh, it's Teach!

05:44.420 --> 05:45.710
Run for it!

05:44.630 --> 05:48.250
<b>DASH</b>

05:45.710 --> 05:48.250
It's very shrimportant that you attend class!

05:50.210 --> 05:53.630
Waaah! She took my lunch!

05:53.630 --> 05:56.000
Oh my, you swindled that kid
out of his lunch?

05:56.830 --> 05:59.500
I want it back! That's my lunch!
Thatsh sho awfur of yew to do.<b></b>

05:56.830 --> 05:57.580
<b>MUNCH</b>

05:57.750 --> 05:59.380
<b>MUNCH</b>

05:59.920 --> 06:01.630
Yew shewrd shtop doing thaph.

06:01.630 --> 06:03.250
If it's so bad...

06:03.250 --> 06:05.210
then you should quit eating it!

06:05.210 --> 06:07.920
My luuuuuuunch!

06:08.130 --> 06:09.420
See what I mean?

06:09.420 --> 06:12.670
You two followed me into trouble
practically all the damn time!

06:12.880 --> 06:15.710
I ain't gonna let you turn around
and play the victim now.

06:16.380 --> 06:17.460
...viously!

06:16.500 --> 06:17.710
<b>RESUME</b>

06:17.880 --> 06:19.380
So, here's the deal...

06:20.460 --> 06:21.960
Hey! That's my chain!

06:21.960 --> 06:25.290
We've taken Benten's chain hostage.

06:25.290 --> 06:27.540
Oh crap! Where is it?! Where is it?!
It's clearly something very important to you.<b></b>

06:27.540 --> 06:28.750
Dammit!

06:28.960 --> 06:31.250
You're gonna have to duel us to get it back!

06:31.250 --> 06:32.670
After we pound you into the dirt,

06:32.670 --> 06:35.040
it'll prove that we're
the rowdiest punksters around!

06:35.040 --> 06:37.130
We're gonna kick your ass!
Those little shits...!<b></b>

06:37.130 --> 06:38.880
Do we rock? Yea-

06:43.920 --> 06:45.920
Where are you going, Benten?!

06:46.080 --> 06:47.920
To give those twerps a beating.

06:50.710 --> 06:52.080
They're gonna pay!

06:52.080 --> 06:55.250
Nobody steals my chain
for stupid shit like that!

07:02.380 --> 07:04.170
Benten!

07:04.170 --> 07:05.330
We gotta follow her!

07:05.580 --> 07:06.790
Of course.

07:06.790 --> 07:09.250
I cannot let things end like this.

07:11.040 --> 07:12.580
It's almost time.

07:13.420 --> 07:14.790
Do we even stand a chance?

07:14.790 --> 07:17.580
She's got the strength of a monster, for sure.

07:17.580 --> 07:19.670
Benten's reputation is legendary.

07:19.670 --> 07:23.920
I heard that one time she beat the hell
out of a group of thugs all by herself.

07:24.380 --> 07:26.630
Then there's Lum.

07:26.630 --> 07:29.500
They say nothing ever sprouts from
the ground after she passes through.

07:29.500 --> 07:33.080
And I remember hearing the story of
a creepo who tried stalking Oyuki once,

07:33.080 --> 07:35.790
but she totally turned the tables on him.

07:36.080 --> 07:40.000
They say that he's still frozen
in the same spot on Neptune, even now.

07:40.000 --> 07:41.290
Ice... ice... ice...

07:41.290 --> 07:43.920
<b>GLOOOOM</b>

07:44.750 --> 07:46.210
We're doomed!

07:46.210 --> 07:48.710
Who thought picking a fight with them
was a good idea?!

07:48.710 --> 07:51.130
They're gonna slaughter us!

07:55.330 --> 07:56.750
Keep it together!

07:57.080 --> 08:00.080
There's still a chance
that we make it through this!

08:00.420 --> 08:02.540
Have faith in the computer!

08:03.330 --> 08:05.500
In Salt #1 here....

08:05.500 --> 08:08.540
I still find it hard to believe
this thing is a computer.

08:08.790 --> 08:10.460
Well, don't worry!

08:10.460 --> 08:14.330
This gizmo helped give us a huge advantage
by picking the best time and place to fight!

08:14.330 --> 08:15.500
It's the perfect plan!

08:15.500 --> 08:17.460
We can use our powers to the fullest!

08:17.710 --> 08:20.250
That's right! Victory will be ours!

08:20.380 --> 08:22.040
<b>WAHAHAHAHA</b>

08:26.880 --> 08:28.380
Benten!

08:29.040 --> 08:30.750
We're coming with you!

08:30.750 --> 08:32.080
Just buzz off!

08:32.080 --> 08:34.130
This is my problem alone to deal with!

08:34.130 --> 08:35.290
You must be joking!

08:35.290 --> 08:38.000
It's just as much a problem for me!

08:38.000 --> 08:40.460
Did you really think I'd just
sit back and do nothing?

08:40.460 --> 08:43.330
Oyuki... I guess I misjudged you.

08:45.540 --> 08:48.290
I thought you were always ice cold.

08:48.290 --> 08:50.580
But you've actually got a warm heart, huh?

08:51.380 --> 08:55.040
<b>FOR LADY BENTEN</b>

08:51.380 --> 08:55.040
<b>INVOICE</b>

08:51.380 --> 08:55.040
<b>COST OF DAMAGED VIDEOTAPE PLAYER</b>

08:51.380 --> 08:55.040
<b>AND PROJECTOR SCREEN</b>

08:51.380 --> 08:55.040
<b>FROM OYUKI</b>

08:55.170 --> 08:56.920
I take back everything I just said!

08:56.920 --> 08:59.330
It's important to be upfront about these things.

08:59.330 --> 09:01.540
By the way, Benten! You forgot something!

09:01.540 --> 09:03.630
Here's a map to the location of the duel!

09:03.630 --> 09:05.170
Uh, what?

09:05.790 --> 09:08.670
You just up and left
without even knowing where to go?

09:12.630 --> 09:14.880
Space vector: Idjit.

09:14.880 --> 09:17.130
Earth time: 4 PM.

09:19.670 --> 09:21.420
We're here for the duel.

09:21.420 --> 09:23.330
You're gonna regret screwing with us.

09:23.330 --> 09:26.250
Heh. So all three of you came together, huh?

09:26.250 --> 09:28.290
We've been looking forward to this, Benten!

09:28.290 --> 09:29.330
Yeah!

09:30.170 --> 09:31.460
I think we should get this next.

09:31.460 --> 09:32.330
Anything else?

09:32.330 --> 09:33.330
What about this one?

09:33.460 --> 09:36.880
How the hell are we suppose to fight
in the middle of all these friggin' people?!

09:36.880 --> 09:40.330
Are you sure about this place
being the Idjit space vector?

09:40.330 --> 09:41.960
I'm positive!

09:43.540 --> 09:46.170
Why did they pick a café on Earth for this...?

09:52.880 --> 09:54.830
<b>SUCK</b>

09:54.830 --> 09:56.540
<b>GOBBLE</b>

09:56.540 --> 09:58.460
<b>SLURP</b>

09:58.580 --> 10:01.080
Hey! Where the hell is my chain, you punks?

10:00.580 --> 10:02.670
<b>SUCK</b>

10:01.080 --> 10:02.670
<b>SLURP</b>

10:01.580 --> 10:02.670
<b>GOBBLE</b>

10:03.210 --> 10:05.080
Say something, dammit!

10:06.000 --> 10:08.830
Don't get your panties in a bunch.
We're keeping it in a safe place.

10:08.830 --> 10:11.420
I'm starting to doubt
you're really here for a duel...

10:11.710 --> 10:13.330
There's no need to rush.

10:13.330 --> 10:15.130
We'll take you down soon enough.

10:15.130 --> 10:18.210
This is just our way of showing you
how confident we are.

10:19.830 --> 10:22.420
Why don't you wipe
your damn faces clean first?!

10:24.500 --> 10:25.880
That's my chain!

10:25.880 --> 10:27.250
Here we go!

10:27.250 --> 10:27.710
Chugga-chugga, chugga-chugga, choo-choo!

10:27.710 --> 10:29.540
Hey! Get back here!
Chugga-chugga, chugga-chugga, choo-choo!<b></b>

10:29.540 --> 10:30.960
Chugga-chugga, chugga-chugga, choo-choo!

10:30.960 --> 10:32.670
Quit running, dammit!
Chugga-chugga, chugga-chugga, choo-choo!<b></b>

10:32.670 --> 10:34.710
Ladies! You still need to pay!

10:34.880 --> 10:36.250
Chugga-chugga, chugga-chugga, choo-choo!

10:36.250 --> 10:38.670
Stop! Don't go a step farther!
Chugga-chugga, chugga-chugga, choo-choo!<b></b>

10:39.630 --> 10:40.420
Lum!

10:40.420 --> 10:41.880
I'm on it!

10:41.880 --> 10:45.290
TIME FOR AN ELECTROSHOOOOCK!

10:46.830 --> 10:48.880
You're not getting away!

10:54.170 --> 10:55.750
Thank you, Lum!

10:56.960 --> 10:58.210
Hey, Sugar!

10:58.210 --> 10:59.790
You handle this!

10:59.790 --> 11:01.210
I'll take that!

11:03.580 --> 11:04.630
Where'd she go?

11:04.630 --> 11:05.920
Did she teleport?

11:11.960 --> 11:14.000
The chain is moving all on its own.

11:14.000 --> 11:16.380
Crap, she can use friggin' telekinesis.

11:16.380 --> 11:18.670
This is gonna be tougher than I thought.

11:20.000 --> 11:23.750
Tremble with fear!
This is the Sugar the Rainbow's supe-

11:23.380 --> 11:24.170
<b>WHACK!</b>

11:23.750 --> 11:24.880
Ow!

11:24.880 --> 11:27.710
H-how did you know that's where I was?!

11:27.710 --> 11:28.880
You dumbass!

11:28.880 --> 11:31.630
Anybody can figure that out
from seeing where the chain is!

11:31.630 --> 11:33.130
Makes sense.

11:33.130 --> 11:35.880
I guess this means you're not
entirely brainless then.

11:37.170 --> 11:38.750
They're all idiots.

11:38.750 --> 11:39.460
Suckers.

11:39.460 --> 11:40.790
Pepper, heads up!

11:40.790 --> 11:42.210
Got it! Yoink!

11:42.540 --> 11:44.750
Ah! Stop right there!

11:47.580 --> 11:48.790
Ginger, over to you!

11:50.040 --> 11:50.790
<b>KERSMACK!</b>

11:51.000 --> 11:51.710
<b>WOMP...</b>

11:51.790 --> 11:52.580
Ginger?!

11:52.830 --> 11:54.250
Ginger!

11:57.000 --> 11:58.250
She's dead.

11:58.250 --> 12:00.080
Hang in there, Ginger!

12:00.670 --> 12:02.960
GINGEEEEEER!

12:05.710 --> 12:08.670
Getting hit by this stupid chain
actually killed her!

12:08.670 --> 12:11.080
If it wasn't for this damn chain...!

12:10.130 --> 12:11.000
<b>DASHY-DASH!</b>

12:11.630 --> 12:12.500
Sugar, take it!

12:12.500 --> 12:13.290
Done!

12:13.380 --> 12:14.000
<b>HUP!</b>

12:15.080 --> 12:16.460
Are you surprised?

12:16.460 --> 12:18.750
This is Ginger the Buddha's
super move: playing dead!

12:18.750 --> 12:19.670
<b>WHAP!</b>

12:19.920 --> 12:21.670
That's hardly worth bragging about!

12:21.670 --> 12:23.500
Man, I have had it up to here with them!

12:29.170 --> 12:30.170
Pass!

12:30.380 --> 12:31.210
Okay!

12:31.210 --> 12:32.170
Hold it!

12:32.170 --> 12:33.420
You won't get fa-

12:34.000 --> 12:35.500
Keep running, Pepper!

12:35.500 --> 12:37.210
Let go, you stupid brat!

12:37.210 --> 12:38.580
You'll have to kill me first!

12:40.130 --> 12:42.750
You think these big boobies
make you hot stuff, huh?

12:42.750 --> 12:43.750
Well nobody cares!

12:43.750 --> 12:45.080
S-SHUT UP, DUMBASS!

12:45.080 --> 12:46.880
DON'T SAY THAT STUFF OUT LOUD!

12:46.880 --> 12:48.290
I've got you now!

12:48.290 --> 12:49.290
Tackle!

12:49.290 --> 12:51.040
Nobody catches Pepper the Snake!

12:51.040 --> 12:52.250
Super move...

12:53.420 --> 12:54.750
MOLTING!

12:53.540 --> 12:55.630
<b>SLIPPERYDOO!</b>

12:54.750 --> 12:55.630
Wha?!

12:57.210 --> 12:58.170
<b>SLIPPERYDOO!</b>

12:58.580 --> 13:00.630
Quit running away! Get back here!

12:58.580 --> 12:59.290
<b>Slip!</b>

12:59.290 --> 13:03.380
<b>Slip!</b>

13:00.630 --> 13:03.380
Argh! Darn you! C'mere!

13:03.380 --> 13:07.830
Wow. Seeing Pepper use her super move
always leaves me in awe.

13:03.880 --> 13:10.290
<b>PLOP</b>

13:07.830 --> 13:10.290
It kinda grosses me out, honestly...

13:10.460 --> 13:12.040
Get back here!

13:12.040 --> 13:13.290
Give it up already!

13:13.290 --> 13:14.250
Take this!

13:15.960 --> 13:18.380
I'VE GOT YOU THIS TIME!

13:23.540 --> 13:25.670
I... I broke it...

13:25.670 --> 13:27.880
Th-this is really bad!

13:27.880 --> 13:29.000
Hey, Lum!

13:29.460 --> 13:31.330
Where'd the freaky snake girl go?

13:31.330 --> 13:33.380
She, uh, got away...

13:33.380 --> 13:35.790
Crap. So they've still got my chain?

13:37.290 --> 13:39.750
Listen, Benten.
Why don't you just give up?

13:39.750 --> 13:41.130
Why the hell should I?!

13:41.130 --> 13:43.960
This fight just seems exceedingly pointless.

13:43.960 --> 13:45.710
Even if those girls were to win...

13:45.710 --> 13:47.540
This isn't about winning or losing!

13:47.540 --> 13:49.460
Can't you just get another chain?

13:50.670 --> 13:52.540
I need that exact chain back.

13:55.000 --> 13:57.830
Do you think someone special
gave it to her or something?

13:57.830 --> 14:01.670
Huh? Benten's never mentioned
anyone like that before.

14:01.670 --> 14:05.210
But the way she's fixated on it isn't normal.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.210
Take a look!

14:07.210 --> 14:08.330
Ain't that sunset a beaut?

14:08.330 --> 14:10.580
There's another sun rising over this way!

14:11.880 --> 14:13.540
Hey. Why'd you stop?

14:13.830 --> 14:14.920
Benten...

14:15.630 --> 14:18.000
Here. I got you this present!

14:19.790 --> 14:21.000
For me...?

14:23.670 --> 14:26.630
Just, uh, think of it like me
and keep it close to ya!

14:26.630 --> 14:29.630
Wh-when did you become
mister charming all of a sudden?

14:29.630 --> 14:30.790
You're making me blush!

14:30.790 --> 14:32.420
Ya friggin' dope!

14:30.790 --> 14:32.330
<b>KERSMACK!</b>

14:32.330 --> 14:36.460
<b>KERSMACK!</b>

14:32.830 --> 14:36.460
But sadly, that turned him into a spirit
who could never return to the mortal plane!

14:36.750 --> 14:39.170
S-so it's a memento of an old lover...?

14:39.170 --> 14:42.130
Gimme a break! What kinda person
do you two take me for?!

14:42.130 --> 14:44.420
It has nothing to do with
that kinda sappy crap!

14:44.420 --> 14:46.330
There's a serious reason that I need it!

14:46.330 --> 14:48.290
<b>WHOM WHOM WHOM WHOM</b>

14:48.290 --> 14:52.210
<b>WHOM WHOM WHOM WHOM</b>

14:54.170 --> 14:55.830
Wh-what is that thing?

14:55.830 --> 14:57.670
Some kinda cook mascot
is flying through the air!

14:59.170 --> 15:00.460
What is that?!

15:05.290 --> 15:08.250
We've got this in the bag
now that Salt #1 is here!

15:24.750 --> 15:27.380
Salt #1! There's something I need to know!

15:29.000 --> 15:33.250
We brought them to the Idjit space vector
just like you directed us to,

15:33.250 --> 15:36.170
but all they do is play dirty
by chasing us around.

15:36.170 --> 15:38.000
They won't even try to fight!

15:38.000 --> 15:38.540
Yeah, it's not fair!

15:38.540 --> 15:39.500
Yeah, it's not fair!
Oh, they have got be kidding!<b></b>

15:39.500 --> 15:40.040
All we want is the chance
to fight them fair and square!
Oh, they have got be kidding!<b></b>

15:40.040 --> 15:42.670
All we want is the chance
to fight them fair and square!
We're only doing that because<b>
</b>you dumbasses keep running away!<b></b>

15:42.670 --> 15:44.790
They're making this really hard
with all those cheap moves!
Well, at least we were fortunate...<b></b>

15:44.790 --> 15:47.290
that a pitfall just happened to be right here.

15:47.290 --> 15:48.710
True that.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.380
It's a little cramped, though.

15:50.380 --> 15:52.330
We don't want to play cat and mouse all day!

15:52.330 --> 15:54.830
Give us a good strategy, Salt #1!

15:58.750 --> 16:01.080
<b>WOOOOOOOOOSH</b>

16:03.880 --> 16:05.540
It's out of power...

16:05.540 --> 16:06.920
What's going on?

16:06.920 --> 16:09.210
Hey, would you like to go get some tea?

16:09.210 --> 16:11.250
I'll carve a dimensional tunnel
out of here if you'll join me.

16:11.250 --> 16:13.540
This ain't the time to
sit around drinking tea!

16:13.540 --> 16:15.960
I gotta get my chain back!

16:16.290 --> 16:17.710
Her chain...

16:18.580 --> 16:20.750
So, Benten, the truth is...

16:21.040 --> 16:23.750
WHAT?! YOU BROKE MY CHAIN?!

16:24.380 --> 16:27.710
Lum. This is it, you and are through.

16:28.290 --> 16:30.670
I cherished that chain
more than anything.

16:30.670 --> 16:33.040
So now I'll take what you cherish most.

16:33.460 --> 16:34.920
No, darling!

16:34.920 --> 16:38.380
Listen, Lum.
Your mistakes are my mistakes.

16:38.380 --> 16:39.880
We gotta pay the price.

16:40.330 --> 16:41.670
Darling!

16:42.250 --> 16:45.330
Bye, Lum! Enjoy the rest of your life!

16:45.330 --> 16:47.710
DAAAAAARLING!

16:47.710 --> 16:50.540
What do you care about more,
your friends or that chain?!

16:50.540 --> 16:52.210
Wh-why does that matter?

16:52.210 --> 16:54.420
I'm asking you which you care about more!

16:54.420 --> 16:55.500
Stop, dummy!

16:55.500 --> 16:58.040
ANSWER THE QUESTION!

16:58.040 --> 17:00.130
Quit shocking us!

17:00.130 --> 17:01.460
I bought what we need!

17:01.460 --> 17:02.250
Awesome!

17:02.250 --> 17:04.290
Good thing they sell it on Earth, too!

17:02.250 --> 17:04.290
<b>Vegetable Oil</b>

17:04.460 --> 17:07.290
Here you go, Salt #1! Have some energy!

17:08.250 --> 17:09.210
<b>RUMBLE</b>

17:15.380 --> 17:16.330
<b>KACHUNK</b>

17:18.210 --> 17:19.920
Wh-what the heck is all this?

17:19.920 --> 17:21.880
Does it have to do with a good strategy?

17:22.670 --> 17:24.670
Whoa! There's a ton of chains!

17:24.920 --> 17:27.540
It's impossible to tell which is the real one.

17:29.540 --> 17:30.790
<b>WHAP!</b>

17:29.920 --> 17:30.790
<b>SWIP!</b>

17:30.290 --> 17:30.790
<b>BLINK!</b>

17:31.710 --> 17:33.040
That's right!

17:33.040 --> 17:37.250
This is the perfect strategy planned by
the best computer in the universe, Salt #1!

17:37.250 --> 17:39.040
You'll never find the real one!

17:39.420 --> 17:40.670
What computer...?

17:40.670 --> 17:41.670
That thing from earlier?

17:41.670 --> 17:43.750
Hurry! Let's split up and run for it!

17:43.750 --> 17:45.250
Keep 'em distracted, right?

17:45.250 --> 17:46.580
See you gals soon!

17:46.830 --> 17:49.210
Ugh, they're too heavy!

17:49.670 --> 17:51.380
Pretty underwhelming after they

17:51.380 --> 17:53.500
made a big deal about that
computer planning their strategy.

17:53.500 --> 17:55.670
This is just pathetic.

17:55.670 --> 17:56.830
Hey, Lum.

17:57.330 --> 17:59.580
Give 'em a burning electric shock for me.

17:59.580 --> 18:01.210
And make it real hot.

18:01.210 --> 18:02.040
Huh?!

18:02.040 --> 18:03.750
G-go ahead, do your worst!

18:03.750 --> 18:05.500
Don't blame us when
your chain melts to mush!

18:05.500 --> 18:07.630
We know it's important to you!

18:07.630 --> 18:11.380
Forget it. You guys can just
burn in hell with my chain.

18:11.630 --> 18:13.000
DO IT, LUM!

18:13.000 --> 18:16.210
HERE GOOOOOOOES!

18:16.210 --> 18:18.290
Next! Rapid freezing!

18:19.630 --> 18:20.960
I'm too tired.

18:20.960 --> 18:23.250
WOULD IT KILL YOU HELP ONCE IN AWHILE?!

18:26.080 --> 18:27.880
<b>FOOOOOOOOOSH</b>

18:28.000 --> 18:30.250
Get this through your fat heads!

18:30.250 --> 18:35.500
My chain ain't some flimsy piece of crap
that you can just get anywhere, dammit!

18:34.040 --> 18:35.500
<b>CRAAAAAASH!</b>

18:46.250 --> 18:47.710
Found it!

18:47.960 --> 18:49.670
<b>KASHEEEEEN!</b>

18:49.670 --> 18:51.290
<b>SOOOTHE</b>

18:50.250 --> 18:52.170
I finally got it back.

18:52.170 --> 18:55.580
B-Benten? Is that it? The real deal?

18:55.580 --> 18:57.040
No doubt about it.

18:57.040 --> 18:59.000
I'm so happy for you!

18:59.000 --> 19:01.790
I was honestly worried you would
never get it back!

19:01.790 --> 19:04.790
W-well, it's nice to see that
you're so happy for me!

19:04.790 --> 19:07.000
You're a good friend, Lum!

19:07.000 --> 19:08.250
What good fortune.

19:08.250 --> 19:11.710
Now that things have wrapped up,
shall we have a cup of tea?

19:11.710 --> 19:14.380
Sure. Let's go to my place!

19:21.580 --> 19:22.830
They gone?

19:22.830 --> 19:24.170
They're gone.

19:24.420 --> 19:24.960
<b>THUMP!</b>

19:25.040 --> 19:26.460
Hey! Who said you could run away?!

19:26.460 --> 19:27.290
You cowards!

19:27.290 --> 19:28.380
Face us!

19:28.380 --> 19:31.080
Curses! They really gave us the slip!

19:31.080 --> 19:33.330
We're not gonna let them
off the hook that easily.

19:34.830 --> 19:36.290
Man, that sucked.

19:36.290 --> 19:39.500
I couldn't go home for ten friggin' days
because of those stupid brats.

19:39.500 --> 19:40.540
Ten whole days?

19:40.540 --> 19:45.080
Hey, Lum. What do you suppose
the deal is with Benten's chain?

19:45.380 --> 19:48.380
I'll tell you one thing,
I'm not going home until I find out!

20:05.710 --> 20:06.670
<b>KA-CLING!</b>

20:06.000 --> 20:06.880
<b>VAWOOOSH!</b>

20:06.540 --> 20:08.710
Welcome home.

20:08.710 --> 20:10.710
Ya see? That's what I needed it for!

20:10.710 --> 20:12.420
The key to your house...?

20:12.420 --> 20:13.540
That's all it was?

20:13.540 --> 20:15.420
What a royal pain in the ass.

20:15.420 --> 20:17.710
I couldn't get in my house at all!

20:17.710 --> 20:20.130
AND YOU DIDN'T THINK
TO CARRY A SPARE KEY?!

20:20.130 --> 20:22.580
Well, I left that one in the house...

20:23.080 --> 20:24.880
Anyway, come on in.

20:24.880 --> 20:26.170
Jeez.

20:26.880 --> 20:28.830
We've been waiting, Benten.

20:29.960 --> 20:32.130
G-godammit! How'd you get in here?!

20:32.130 --> 20:34.210
The back door was wide open.

20:34.210 --> 20:36.210
That's really dangerous, you know.

20:38.790 --> 20:41.000
How dare you chicken out
in the middle of our fight!

20:41.000 --> 20:43.880
That chain you took with you
was nothing but a fake!

20:43.880 --> 20:46.040
The real one is... right here!

20:46.040 --> 20:48.670
If you want it back, then you gotta fight us!

20:51.170 --> 20:53.130
Ah, this is delicious.

20:53.130 --> 20:56.210
Seems you left the back door open, Benten.

20:56.210 --> 20:58.420
So about that back door...
Oh yeah? So you're a fan of the tea?<b></b>

20:58.420 --> 21:00.830
I'm glad to hear that, Oyuki!

21:00.830 --> 21:03.210
Seriously, Benten?
Hey! The real chain is here!<b></b>

21:03.210 --> 21:05.080
You didn't consider the back door?
Come fight us if you want it back!<b></b>

21:05.080 --> 21:07.960
You didn't consider the back door?
Yep! Everything's just great!<b></b>

21:08.460 --> 21:10.290
Darn it! Listen to me!

21:10.290 --> 21:13.130
Why won't you just fight us already?!

21:16.580 --> 21:19.500
Mada tarinai ai shitetaiyaiya

21:19.500 --> 21:22.500
Anata igai kangaerarenai ya

21:22.500 --> 21:25.250
Atashi o suite atashi dake mite

21:25.250 --> 21:28.250
Mou anata no zui made aishiteru

21:39.420 --> 21:42.420
Hitomi no okusoko dare o matteru no?

21:42.420 --> 21:45.380
Anata wa yokogao shika misetenai wa

21:45.380 --> 21:46.790
Oshiete hoshii no

21:46.790 --> 21:49.130
Give me love give me love dake

21:50.920 --> 21:54.000
Donna hoshi yori mo kono chikyuujou ni

21:54.000 --> 21:56.830
Anata ga itakara sui ochite kita no

21:56.830 --> 21:59.040
Kotaete hoshii no aimai o

21:59.040 --> 22:00.130
I need you o

22:00.130 --> 22:01.380
Aitai nankai shitai

22:01.380 --> 22:02.920
Ai shiaitai

22:02.920 --> 22:04.580
Nee nee darling darling

22:04.580 --> 22:05.960
Uchuu no hate made

22:05.960 --> 22:07.460
Nee nee darling darling

22:07.460 --> 22:08.750
Hanareta koi mo

22:08.750 --> 22:11.250
Hoshi to tsuki nutte maite

22:11.250 --> 22:13.250
Daki yosete yo

22:13.250 --> 22:14.210
Datte

22:14.210 --> 22:16.920
Mada tarinai ai shitetaiyaiya

22:16.920 --> 22:19.880
Anata igai kangaerarenai ya

22:19.880 --> 22:22.710
Atashi o suite atashi dake mite

22:22.710 --> 22:25.540
Mou anata no zui made aishiteru

22:25.540 --> 22:28.460
Mada dame dame doko ni mo nigecha iya

22:28.460 --> 22:31.290
Anata to iu hoshi de mawaritai no

22:31.290 --> 22:34.210
Nee kocchi muite mata soppo muite

22:34.210 --> 22:37.330
Soredemo tada anata ga suki dakara

22:37.540 --> 22:39.000
Zettai zettai

22:39.000 --> 22:40.380
Biribri shichau no

22:40.380 --> 22:41.920
Genkai genkai

22:41.920 --> 22:43.330
Ai tarinai

22:46.040 --> 22:50.960
<b>Cosmo Teacher CAO-2</b>

22:46.040 --> 22:50.960
<b>Ooh, Scary! Voodoo Doll</b>

22:46.290 --> 22:48.580
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura"!

22:48.580 --> 22:50.630
Oh no, not CAO-2...
